<p>On the basis of exchange rates on 1 - 4 August 1997, the average UK RMG is greater than +5 per cent, at 9.460 per cent. It is, therefore currently forecast to enter its fifth and final confirmation period on 11 August prior to a possible revaluation on 21 August. All currencies with negative RMGs for this period will devalue on 11 August. Hence, further green rate devaluations are currently forecast for the Danish, Spanish and Portuguese green rates. During confirmation periods the 3-day (6 per cent) rule is suspended.</p>
